# Publish after update

When the user asks to fix, update, or ship changes to this repo's 作戰室 sites (HTML/CSS/JS/data the hub serves):

1. Run `node tools/run-phase0.mjs` if the change touches subject apps or data.
2. Bump cache query strings (`?v=YYYYMMDDx`) on every touched `index.html` and the root hub `index.html` when styles/scripts change.
3. **Commit and push to `origin/main`** in the same session unless the user explicitly says not to publish yet.
4. After push, tell the user the live URL: https://iasome.github.io/taiwan-cap-math/

Do not commit `tmp_*` scratch files or one-off debug scripts unless the user asks.
